        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "My lord asked his servants, saying, Have ye a father, or a brother?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:19",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And we said unto my lord, We have a father, an old man, and a child of his old age, a little one; and his brother is dead, and he alone is left of his mother, and his father loveth him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "Gen. 42:11 (11–13)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:20",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou saidst unto thy servants, Bring him down unto me, that I may set mine eyes upon him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:21",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And we said unto my lord, The lad cannot leave his father: for if he should leave his father, his father would die.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 65
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 104
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:22",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou saidst unto thy servants, Except your youngest brother come down with you, ye shall see my face no more.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "Gen. 43:5 (3–5)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:23",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass when we came up unto thy servant my father, we told him the words of my lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:24",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "And our father said, Go again, and buy us a little food.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 34
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:25",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "And we said, We cannot go down: if our youngest brother be with us, then will we go down: for we may not see the man’s face, except our youngest brother be with us.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 136,
            "end": 144,
