          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:28",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "And if ye take this also from me, and mischief befall him, ye shall bring down my gray hairs with sorrow to the grave.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "Gen. 42:36 (36–38)."
          },
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 57,
            "text": "Gen. 42:4; 49:27 (26–28); Josh. 18:11 (11–28)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Genesis 44:29",
        "book": "Genesis",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "Now therefore when I come to thy servant my father, and the lad be not with us; seeing that his life is bound up in the lad’s life;",
        "footNotes": [
